    "body": "## Scope\n\nAdd paired light and dark presentation variants for all five generational UI profiles. This is Stage 6.2 and does not reopen accepted Stage 6.1 or start Stage 7.\n\nExact changed files:\n- `AsyncScene/Web/index.html`\n- `docs/index.html`\n- `AsyncScene/Web/ui/ui-color-mode.js`\n- `docs/ui/ui-color-mode.js`\n- `AsyncScene/Web/ui/ui-color-modes.css`\n- `docs/ui/ui-color-modes.css`\n- `tools/test_stage6_2_dual_color_modes.py`\n\n## Architecture\n\n- Accepted Stage 6.1 `style.css`, `style-base.css`, and `ui-profile-themes.css` remain byte-identical and provide the fallback layer.\n- A synchronous head controller resolves local `system/light/dark` preference before stylesheet paint.\n- `system` follows `prefers-color-scheme` and updates live; explicit `light` or `dark` persists only in localStorage.\n- A separate mode stylesheet supplies ten explicit profile/mode token sets.\n- Menu controls expose `Авто`, `Светлая`, and `Тёмная` without reading or mutating game state.\n- New `ui/` files use the existing Xcode synchronized root and require no duplicate PBX resource entries.\n\n## Variant contract\n\n- Boomer light: accepted cream/burgundy/brass theme.\n- Boomer dark: mahogany study, brass and muted burgundy.\n- Gen X light: off-white hardware panel, rust and muted teal.\n- Gen X dark: accepted charcoal/rust/teal theme.\n- Millennial light: accepted warm white/indigo/teal theme.\n- Millennial dark: espresso-indigo surfaces with teal and dusty rose.\n- Zoomer light: daylight violet/cyan with restrained lime.\n- Zoomer dark: accepted violet/cyan neon theme.\n- Alpha light: accepted aqua/coral/violet theme.\n- Alpha dark: deep-space aqua/coral/violet theme.\n\nEach profile keeps the same geometry in both modes. Semantic reward, warning, danger and disabled tokens remain owned by the accepted base stylesheet.\n\n## Executed validation\n\n- `ui-color-mode.js`: `node --check` PASS.\n- Executable Node harness PASS:\n  - system bootstrap resolves light when system media is light;\n  - explicit dark persists and ignores system changes;\n  - returning to system clears local override;\n  - system changes update the resolved root mode;\n  - invalid preference normalizes to system.\n- `ui-color-modes.css`: parsed by `tinycss2` with 21 top-level rules and zero syntax errors.\n- Ten profile/mode rows present and ten signatures distinct.\n- Main text contrast / primary-action contrast:\n  - Boomer light `14.83 / 8.73`\n  - Boomer dark `13.62 / 5.37`\n  - Gen X light `13.59 / 6.53`\n  - Gen X dark `11.65 / 5.36`\n  - Millennial light `14.64 / 5.04`\n  - Millennial dark `14.21 / 5.78`\n  - Zoomer light `16.59 / 6.77`\n  - Zoomer dark `16.22 / 5.18`\n  - Alpha light `15.56 / 5.55`\n  - Alpha dark `14.58 / 9.90`\n- Accepted Stage 6.1 variants are reproduced token-for-token as one half of their pairs.\n- Source/docs readback blobs:\n  - index `b72e3d490684c50b9051b3d49725291133f1400a`\n  - controller `95367be790975391248b17def3dfd8c357a21ea6`\n  - mode CSS `e5c02e420a9f300d60bbfea426a184e5758859cc`\n- Regression Python compiled successfully. Repository has no applicable CI workflow for this path set; final live hash and visual acceptance remain user-owned Safari gates.\n\n## Guardrails\n\nNo game state, mechanics, economy, profile copy routing, dependencies, or Stage 7 changes. Do not declare final Stage 6.2 visual PASS before live 5×2 Safari review.",
